{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"赤柱獨立屋千萬美元珠寶失竊　疑為傭人所為\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/THEFT-STANLEY-261029-17.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】赤柱舂磡角道一間獨立屋約值1000萬美元珠寶失竊。</p><p>現場是赤柱舂磡角道紫荊園。警方下午1時許接獲報案，消息指戶主外遊回家後，發現兩件珠寶失竊，約值1000萬美元，懷疑與傭人有關。警方暫列盜竊案處理。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:25.116525+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:14:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T20:18:11.687840+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:58:26.434564+00:00","content_hash":"10f498615da6d7550045e1bb505e9927a5f8f410069d1dbba64b270b040dd6ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:01:25.116525+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}